  "abstract_summary": "Agents that write memory from their own runs give the next session a rewritten account of them. We measure how far that account moves the next decision from the one made on a run log of the same runs. We replayed the memory pipeline of OpenAI's open-source Codex agent, with declared departures, over scripted tasks i...",
